---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import photo from "../assets/Christian_Whitmer.jpg";

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
    title="About"
    description="Meet Christian Whitmer — web, tech, and ministry at Blackhawk."
>
    <div class="about">
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="hero-badge">About Me</div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">
                Meet <span class="hero-accent">Christian Whitmer</span>
            </h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
            <div class="profile-card">
                <img
                    src={photo.src}
                    alt="Christian Whitmer"
                    class="photo"
                    width="220"
                    height="220"
                />
                <blockquote class="endorsement">
                    <p>
                        "Christian brings an extensive understanding of
                        all-things-technical to the ministry of Blackhawk… he
                        brings a broad technical expertise to enhance our church
                        ministry. And with all of that, he brings a servant's
                        heart and spirit."
                    </p>
                    <cite>— Dale Siegelin</cite>
                </blockquote>
            </div>

            <div class="prose-content">
                <p class="intro">
                    I'm Christian Whitmer, and I've been blessed to serve at <strong
                        >Blackhawk</strong
                    > for nearly nine years. I'm not married and don't have children
                    in the traditional sense — but I do have a small dog named <strong
                        >Ollie</strong
                    > who has firmly established himself as the child of the household!
                </p>

                <section class="section">
                    <h2>
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="18"
                            height="18"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                            ><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2"
                            ></rect><path
                                d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"
                            ></path></svg
                        >
                        Professional Role
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        Most of my ministry happens behind the scenes. I'm
                        responsible for:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Managing the church website</li>
                        <li>Creating printed materials and publications</li>
                        <li>
                            Designing graphics and videos for services and
                            events
                        </li>
                        <li>Providing technical support and troubleshooting</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        With my background in technology, I often serve as the
                        Sunday morning technical troubleshooter. If you spot me
                        rushing around on a Sunday — even if everything appears
                        normal — there's likely something that needs attention!
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="section">
                    <h2>
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="18"
                            height="18"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                            ><path
                                d="M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3L14.5 4z"
                            ></path><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="3"></circle></svg
                        >
                        Personal Interests
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        When I'm not serving at Blackhawk, you'll likely find
                        me:
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Flying my drone</li>
                        <li>Creating with my 3D printer</li>
                        <li>Listening to audiobooks and podcasts</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section class="section">
                    <h2>
                        <svg
                            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                            width="18"
                            height="18"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                            ><path d="M18 20V10"></path><path d="M12 20V4"
                            ></path><path d="M6 20v-6"></path></svg
                        >
                        Faith Journey &amp; Background
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        Though born in South Georgia, I spent most of my
                        childhood in upstate New York after my family relocated
                        when I was 18 months old. Ministry runs deep in my
                        family — my grandfather, father, and great-grandfather
                        were all pastors. At one point we had approximately <strong
                            >14 family members</strong
                        > serving in full-time ministry.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        I was saved and baptized at a young age in a small rural
                        church in Elmira, NY — a special moment, as my father
                        baptized me in the same church where my grandfather
                        served as pastor.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        After graduating from high school and college in
                        Kentucky, I began my ministry career there over 20 years
                        ago. Following a brief period in Georgia, I moved to
                        Fort Wayne on <strong>February 14, 2017</strong> — my birthday
                        and first day on staff at Blackhawk. I've fallen in love with
                        both this city and our church community, and I look forward
                        to many more years of service here.
                    </p>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .about {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        padding-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.275rem 0.875rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.07em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--accent-2);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, transparent);
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, transparent);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .hero-title {
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        line-height: 1.15;
        color: var(--text);
        margin: 0;
    }

    .hero-accent {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, #7c3aed 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
    }

    /* Profile card */
    .profile-card {
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
        align-items: flex-start;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .photo {
        width: 160px;
        height: 160px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 12px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .endorsement {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        border: none;
    }

    .endorsement p {
        font-size: 0.975rem;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.75;
        font-style: italic;
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    }

    .endorsement cite {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--accent-2);
        font-style: normal;
    }

    /* Prose */
    .intro {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .section {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .section h2 {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        color: var(--text);
        margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
        padding-bottom: 0.625rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .section h2 svg {
        color: var(--accent);
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .section p {
        font-size: 0.975rem;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
    }

    .section ul {
        margin: 0 0 0.875rem 1.25rem;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .section ul li {
        font-size: 0.975rem;
        color: var(--text-2);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .profile-card {
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .photo {
            width: 130px;
            height: 130px;
        }
    }
</style>
